
# megh-full-dup-qwen (2026-11-16): deployment files keep LF on every checkout — a CRLF in a Docker env_file would put an
# invisible "\r" at the end of every value (keys, URLs), and nginx / shell / Dockerfiles expect LF on Linux.
deploy/megh-full-dup-qwen/*.env* text eol=lf
deploy/nginx/*.conf text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
voice_engine/** text eol=lf
voice_engine/**/*.json text eol=lf
docker-compose*.yml text eol=lf
voice_engine/**/*.wav binary
